  "about": {
    "title": "About the EX Team Rocket Returns set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: EX Team Rocket Returns is a EX expansion released on 1 November 2004. It has 111 cards: 109 in the main set and 2 secret rares. There are also 95 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 109 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (204 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 206 cards, adding the 2 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
